%% LINE Chat Bot activity - Part 3/4: answer with the LLM and allow-listed tools
%% Sources: apps/api/src/bot/conversation.ts, apps/api/src/bot/mcp-client.ts, apps/api/src/llm-client.ts, apps/api/src/analytics/mcp.ts
flowchart TD
 Start([Part 2: scope resolved]) --> BranchCtx[Load branch names<br/>in scope only]
 BranchCtx --> Prompt[Build the prompt<br/>role + scope + tools]
 Prompt --> Tools[Request tools from MCP<br/>with the signed scope]
 Tools --> Llm[Call the LLM with the question<br/>maxSteps = 2]

 Llm --> ToolCall{LLM calls a tool?}
 ToolCall -->|Yes| Call[Call that tool, stripping<br/>accessScope from model args]
 Call --> Query[Run a parameterized query<br/>against ClickHouse]
 Query --> Result[Feed the result back to the LLM]
 Result --> Llm

 ToolCall -->|No| Answer[Assemble the Thai answer]
 Answer --> Next([Part 4: reply])

 classDef startEnd fill:#E6E6FA,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:darkblue
 classDef process fill:#90EE90,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:darkgreen
 classDef decision fill:#FFD700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:black
 classDef cloud fill:#FFF3B0,stroke:#B8860B,stroke-width:2px,color:#5C4033
 classDef data fill:#E6E6FA,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:darkblue

 class Start,Next startEnd
 class Prompt,Tools,Call,Result,Answer process
 class ToolCall decision
 class Llm cloud
